### 1. Root Service Health Check
GET http://localhost:5000/

### 2. Detailed API & Database Health Check
GET http://localhost:5000/api/breathing/health

### 3. Send Grok AI Chat Message
POST http://localhost:5000/api/chat
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "message": "What should I do if I start wheezing during an outdoor run?",
  "sessionId": "demo-session-1"
}

### 4. Fetch Saved Chat History from MongoDB
GET http://localhost:5000/api/chat/history?sessionId=demo-session-1

### 5. Register New User
POST http://localhost:5000/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Isaac Newton",
  "email": "isaac@asthmasense.ai",
  "password": "Password123!"
}

### 6. Login User
POST http://localhost:5000/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "isaac@asthmasense.ai",
  "password": "Password123!"
}
